WEBVTT

00:14.920 --> 00:15.670
Whoa!

00:17.920 --> 00:19.630
Ouch. Ow...

00:20.250 --> 00:21.920
N... Natsukawa?

00:21.920 --> 00:23.920
Oh! Wataru...

00:23.920 --> 00:25.880
Ow, ow, ow...

00:27.830 --> 00:29.790
Why are you in such a hurry?

00:45.040 --> 00:49.000
<b>The Dreaming Boy</b>

00:45.040 --> 00:49.000
<b>is a Realist</b>

00:49.130 --> 00:54.710
With a command from the sky that's peeking out,
we hold onto our feelings as we depart

00:54.710 --> 00:59.420
Even though our eyes meet,
we're swayed by the wind into a roundabout way

01:00.500 --> 01:06.000
A dream snapshot taken by the blink of the eyes;
the memories adorn my heart

01:06.000 --> 01:11.420
It seems I like these times; even though they're frustrating

01:12.460 --> 01:17.330
Staying away then getting closer; a dream I'd started to give up on

01:17.580 --> 01:23.000
The day I can land that well; I want to try chasing after that

01:23.000 --> 01:28.420
The sky is filled up with the things that can't be all conveyed

01:28.580 --> 01:34.210
For some reason, the change in countenance
of your true feelings was at odds

01:34.210 --> 01:42.500
Even though I might get lost, the sky always had two heartbeats

01:42.500 --> 01:45.040
I've told you many times

01:45.210 --> 01:51.210
If these youthful feelings are joined together,
I wonder what kind of view will spread out

01:51.210 --> 01:55.880
I want to know that colorful feeling

02:02.380 --> 02:04.080
Ow, ow, ow...

02:02.710 --> 02:05.670
<b>You Smell Like Sweat... You Must've Worked Hard.</b>

02:09.920 --> 02:10.790
Huh?

02:13.000 --> 02:14.380
What's up with that?

02:14.380 --> 02:17.880
Well, you see, I was doing manual labor today, so...

02:18.080 --> 02:19.170
Yeah, I saw you.

02:19.170 --> 02:20.000
You saw me!?

02:20.290 --> 02:23.460
Natsukawa saw me!? So, she noticed me!?

02:23.460 --> 02:26.500
Hang on, since when...?
Why didn't she call out to me then-

02:26.750 --> 02:28.460
There's no way she'd do something like that...

02:32.040 --> 02:35.790
You smell like sweat... You must've worked hard.

02:35.790 --> 02:36.670
Whoa!

02:36.920 --> 02:41.290
Wh-what the!? What's going on!? You know,
this is an unprecedented super close distance!

02:41.630 --> 02:44.460
Since this is the first time she's seen me in a while,
is her sense of distance like glitchy or something!?

02:44.830 --> 02:46.380
N-Natsukawa...

02:46.380 --> 02:47.210
What's up?

02:47.500 --> 02:51.130
U-um... Did something good happen?

02:51.130 --> 02:51.790
What?

02:52.130 --> 02:56.250
Well, it's like you've got a gentle vibe
going on, so to speak...

02:56.580 --> 02:59.000
And it's like, you're closer than usual, so...

02:59.000 --> 02:59.790
What!?

03:01.170 --> 03:06.040
Well, of course that's how it'd be... There's no way
Natsukawa would consciously come closer to me...

03:06.630 --> 03:08.880
S-sorry! It's hot here...!

03:08.880 --> 03:13.420
D-dammit, she's so cute! If I let my guard down,
I might end up going overboard, singing her praises...

03:14.330 --> 03:18.380
S-so, what's going on?
You seem like you were in a hurry...

03:18.830 --> 03:21.170
Well, that's... Um...

03:22.630 --> 03:24.580
That's because I saw you...

03:24.750 --> 03:25.630
Huh...?

03:26.500 --> 03:29.080
I came running over because I saw you!

03:29.210 --> 03:32.540
F-for me!? Now why would you do something like that?

03:32.750 --> 03:37.250
Wh-why...? Conversely, why didn't you call out to me!?

03:37.540 --> 03:41.710
Why...? I thought it'd be better
if I didn't pester Natsukawa, so...

03:42.250 --> 03:44.750
We finally got to meet up in the longest time, and yet...

03:45.460 --> 03:47.830
Th-that's like sad, you know...?

03:49.290 --> 03:50.630
Could you be any cuter...!?

03:50.880 --> 03:53.210
Than what!? Honestly! It's that kind of stuff, you know!?

03:53.920 --> 03:56.500
You know, "it's that kind of stuff," right back at you.

03:58.130 --> 04:02.170
Yeah, my bad... I didn't readily have any free time, so...

04:02.630 --> 04:05.500
I know. You said so in your messages.

04:05.500 --> 04:07.540
Oh, yeah. That's right.

04:07.920 --> 04:10.000
You said there was a lot going on at your part-time job.

04:10.000 --> 04:12.250
Like with Ichinose-san and stuff?

04:12.250 --> 04:13.750
Yeah, that worked out well.

04:13.830 --> 04:18.380
Natsukawa, it's thanks to you, because you told me
to make sure to listen properly to her. Thanks...

04:18.670 --> 04:21.710
You were able to properly hit it off with her then...

04:21.710 --> 04:27.880
Yeah, probably excellently. I wouldn't say it's perfect,
but I think our relationship got better.

04:28.170 --> 04:29.960
I see. Good for you...

04:29.960 --> 04:32.210
Yeah. I'm honestly relieved...

04:34.290 --> 04:36.130
H-huh!? That's it!?

04:36.290 --> 04:40.500
Aren't you going to ask more about
what happened after that? Y-you're not curious?

04:40.500 --> 04:45.420
No, it's an issue about another family, so is this
Natsukawa being mannerly and not diving deeper?

04:45.670 --> 04:49.170
Well, she probably isn't particularly
interested in my stories, so...

04:49.580 --> 04:51.330
In any case, it's been a while, you know?

04:51.630 --> 04:54.580
Is this the first time we've met up properly
since the end-of-term ceremony?

04:55.080 --> 04:55.920
Yeah...

04:55.920 --> 04:58.210
Right... Did you get a little tan?

04:58.210 --> 05:01.500
Y-yeah... I went to the ocean with Kei and-

05:01.500 --> 05:04.420
Oh! Speaking of, there was a photo from Ashida...

05:04.710 --> 05:10.040
Th-that's right! The photo from that time!
Kei unsent that, but do you still have it!?

05:10.040 --> 05:12.830
Huh!? Oh, well, it's not a big deal, you know!?

05:12.830 --> 05:15.380
Hey! That's not an answer, you know!?

05:15.380 --> 05:16.670
Huh? What?

05:16.670 --> 05:18.250
Let me borrow your smartphone.

05:18.580 --> 05:19.830
What!? Huh!? What!?

05:29.000 --> 05:32.000
N-Natsukawa. So...

05:32.380 --> 05:34.580
Hey... Wataru-

05:34.580 --> 05:35.540
Huh!?

05:35.710 --> 05:39.420
Oh! Aichi, it is you! Also, Sajotchi!

05:40.540 --> 05:41.330
Huh!?

05:41.330 --> 05:42.080
Kei!

05:45.580 --> 05:47.080
I mean, honestly!

05:47.080 --> 05:51.040
You surprised me! You like suddenly pounced on me!

05:51.040 --> 05:53.210
S-sorry! I couldn't help it.

05:53.210 --> 05:55.540
Nah! If anything, that made me happy!

05:56.170 --> 05:57.250
Here you go.

05:57.250 --> 05:58.630
Thank you, Sajotchi.

05:58.710 --> 06:00.290
Th-thanks.

06:00.290 --> 06:02.250
Do you like have club activities every day?

06:02.460 --> 06:07.250
It's not exactly every day,
but the volleyball club has a lot of matches.

06:07.630 --> 06:10.960
Even from just here on, there's like the summer season
tournament and an interleague match.

06:10.960 --> 06:14.250
Kei is expected to become
a starting player next year, right?

06:15.460 --> 06:17.210
You know, you're like super energetic.

06:17.420 --> 06:19.290
Sajotchi, did you get tan too?

06:19.290 --> 06:21.000
Oh, I went to Mishirohama-

06:21.500 --> 06:24.380
I was going back and forth
to my part-time job, so yeah!

06:24.630 --> 06:27.880
Huh? What's up, Sajotchi? You're like flustered.

06:27.880 --> 06:29.830
There's nothing I have to feel guilty about!

06:29.830 --> 06:32.000
That's what people who've done something guilty say!

06:32.130 --> 06:36.040
Dammit! Why is it that she's oddly astute,
just at times like this?

06:36.040 --> 06:40.290
Do I say I went on an outing with a college
student-like middle schooler...? There's no way!

06:40.830 --> 06:42.000
Why don't you sit down?

06:42.330 --> 06:43.330
C'mon, here.

06:43.330 --> 06:44.630
Huh!? There!?

06:44.630 --> 06:45.670
You don't want to?

06:45.920 --> 06:47.920
I-it's not that I don't want to, but...

06:49.960 --> 06:52.460
So... Why are you here today?

06:52.670 --> 06:54.540
Oh yeah! That!

06:54.790 --> 06:56.750
I was asked by Big Sis.

06:57.250 --> 07:01.130
She told me to help out with all kinds
of stuff for the set-up of the school visit tour.

07:01.290 --> 07:02.960
Huh? Why you, Sajotchi?

07:02.960 --> 07:05.250
You see, there are various reasons for that.

07:05.580 --> 07:07.210
You're being relied on!

07:07.210 --> 07:09.500
Not at all! I'm just a lackey...

07:10.210 --> 07:15.380
That reminds me, the guides... For that,
average-looking guys were unwanted, you know?

07:15.830 --> 07:17.040
Huh? What do you mean?

07:17.250 --> 07:18.580
Shinomiya-senpai...

07:18.580 --> 07:19.130
What!?

07:19.130 --> 07:19.830
Whoa!

07:20.710 --> 07:23.250
She kind of sheepishly said that...

07:23.790 --> 07:25.960
You see, in order to increase the
number of prospective applicants,

07:25.960 --> 07:29.080
they purposely assigned "highly capable" guys...

07:29.380 --> 07:30.580
Huh!

07:30.830 --> 07:31.960
What's up with that?

07:32.330 --> 07:36.250
I get it, if it's you, Aichi! You're cute and you're smart!

07:36.250 --> 07:37.920
But that thing about "capable" is...

07:37.920 --> 07:41.080
Well, you know, she didn't put it in that way, though...

07:41.580 --> 07:46.210
And see, in the end, I'm glad it was Sasaki
and Natsukawa, the top 2 of our class...

07:46.210 --> 07:48.830
Sajotchi, do you really think that?

07:48.830 --> 07:50.170
Huh? What about that?

07:50.170 --> 07:55.460
Didn't you want to act as a guide instead
of Sasaki-kun? Together with Aichi?

07:55.710 --> 07:56.830
How about that?

07:57.080 --> 08:01.460
Oh! Someone like me; no way! Impossible!
Plus, I don't even do club activities, so...

08:01.750 --> 08:04.670
But you helped out Ichinose-san, right?

08:04.670 --> 08:08.790
Well... That just happened to turn out that way,
or rather, I couldn't ignore that, so to speak...

08:09.080 --> 08:12.670
An ulterior motive? Hey, was there an ulterior motive?

08:12.830 --> 08:15.080
There wasn't. What's with that look?

08:15.500 --> 08:18.670
Well, of course, I was trying to communicate
for the sake of the part-time job, so...

08:18.670 --> 08:22.790
Well, yeah! Sajotchi, pestering someone
is your signature move, right!?

08:22.790 --> 08:24.130
Hey! Watch what you say!

08:25.710 --> 08:27.750
Don't annoy her too much, okay?

08:29.210 --> 08:32.790
I won't... Not to anyone, not anymore...

08:36.580 --> 08:38.250
Will you come to school again?

08:38.250 --> 08:38.920
Huh?

08:38.920 --> 08:44.460
Yeah... There's a bit of dismantlement work
and like administrative work left, so...

08:44.460 --> 08:45.380
And you, Kei?

08:45.380 --> 08:48.380
Well, it'll be club activities the whole time, probably...

08:48.380 --> 08:49.250
I see...

08:54.130 --> 08:54.880
Hey...

08:56.670 --> 08:57.920
Let's meet up again!

08:57.920 --> 08:58.710
What?

08:59.250 --> 09:02.040
Let's get together after the school visit tour!

09:03.130 --> 09:04.460
You don't want to...?

09:05.330 --> 09:07.580
Th-that's totally okay, but...

09:08.500 --> 09:09.210
Yeah!

09:09.710 --> 09:13.000
Oh, but I don't know when this will finish on my end.

09:13.580 --> 09:18.290
The tour visit schedule is probably all set,
but as to how long it'll take for the cleanup side...

09:18.500 --> 09:22.710
Yeah, that's fine! In that case, we'll just
talk trash about you Sajotchi, while we wait!

09:22.830 --> 09:25.380
If you're going to say stuff like that,
then gimme back the iced tea!

09:25.500 --> 09:26.580
No!

09:27.330 --> 09:29.250
I'll let go if you apologize!

09:29.250 --> 09:31.040
Hey! C'mon, you two!

09:31.420 --> 09:32.130
Whoa!

09:32.460 --> 09:33.540
Aichi!?

09:35.080 --> 09:37.000
<b>Hamaminami Book Store</b>

09:37.210 --> 09:39.580
Good job today, Ichinose-san. See you tomorrow.

09:39.580 --> 09:42.630
Oh! Sajo-kun, you're off tomorrow.

09:42.630 --> 09:45.170
Oh! That's right. The school visit tour!

09:45.170 --> 09:45.830
Yeah.

09:46.210 --> 09:49.790
Thanks, Ichinose-san. I would've ended up skipping it.

09:51.790 --> 09:52.790
Not at all.

09:53.210 --> 09:57.130
Ichinose-san, you're going to be by yourself
the entire day at work, but will you be okay?

09:57.130 --> 10:00.250
I-I will be fine! Sajo-kun, good job today too!

10:00.460 --> 10:06.540
Thanks! Well, I'm counting on you then!
I'll let Ichinose-senpai know that you're dependable.

10:06.540 --> 10:08.880
Oh... I-I'm not quite there yet...

10:12.040 --> 10:16.040
<b>The Dreaming Boy</b>

10:12.040 --> 10:16.040
<b>is a Realist</b>

10:22.380 --> 10:26.790
There is a greeting from the Koetsu High School
Student Council President to everyone,

10:26.790 --> 10:29.920
so please gather at the gym first!

10:30.170 --> 10:32.080
The gym is that way!

10:41.630 --> 10:46.080
To all the middle school students.
Welcome to Koetsu High School.

10:46.960 --> 10:49.170
I am Hayato Yuuki, the Student Council President.

10:50.330 --> 10:58.380
Today will be about what kind of place Koetsu High
School is, as well as what kind of students are enrolled.

10:59.000 --> 11:02.170
It will make me happy, if this is an opportunity for you
to get to know at least a little about this school.

11:02.170 --> 11:04.420
That's so you, Student Council President...

11:05.040 --> 11:08.380
He instantly captivated the female students
in the assembly hall...

11:09.460 --> 11:12.710
Now then, that will be all for my greetings.

11:15.290 --> 11:18.420
As expected, he is our school's prince...

11:19.960 --> 11:24.460
Well, our school's princess seems to be looking
charmingly at the middle schoolers...

11:25.630 --> 11:28.920
For the time being, I'm probably the gofer or something...

11:30.670 --> 11:38.170
Let's see, from the Mishirohama Middle School.
Is it Inoue-san, Sasaki-san, Nakata-san, Yamamoto-san?

11:38.880 --> 11:43.130
I am everyone's guide. My name is Sasaki.
It's nice to meet you today.

11:43.130 --> 11:44.330
N-nice to...

11:44.330 --> 11:45.790
Meet you...

11:46.540 --> 11:50.250
The other Sasaki-san; we're the same Sasaki,
but with different kanji characters.

11:50.670 --> 11:53.380
My "Sasaki" is made up of the
kanji radicals for "person" and "left."

11:53.380 --> 11:54.920
Whoa!

11:55.540 --> 11:57.500
My "Sasaki" uses the "bamboo" radical.

11:58.080 --> 12:01.630
So, there is one more person who
will be guiding all of you with me.

12:01.630 --> 12:04.130
I am Natsukawa. Nice to meet you.

12:04.130 --> 12:05.920
Nice to meet you!

12:07.000 --> 12:08.830
We're going to go around the campus now,

12:09.170 --> 12:11.830
but we should probably ask beforehand,
if there is anything you're curious about.

12:12.290 --> 12:13.210
Is there anything?

12:13.210 --> 12:15.210
Yes! May I ask one thing!?

12:15.380 --> 12:16.040
Go ahead.

12:16.380 --> 12:18.670
Do you mind my asking what
the relationship is, between the two of you!?

12:18.880 --> 12:19.540
What!?

12:19.830 --> 12:20.920
He turned red!

12:20.920 --> 12:21.920
He did!

12:22.130 --> 12:22.880
Hey...

12:22.880 --> 12:25.210
Sasaki-kun and I are just classmates.

12:26.880 --> 12:29.290
What? Is that so?

12:29.670 --> 12:31.210
Now then, shall we get going?

12:31.630 --> 12:35.080
Oh, we will not be answering
any more personal questions.

12:36.080 --> 12:37.330
Okay.

12:37.670 --> 12:39.750
I-I'm sorry...

12:40.000 --> 12:41.170
It's okay...

12:42.130 --> 12:46.920
There are roughly 630 students in the whole school.
Each class year has 6 classes.

12:47.080 --> 12:51.500
Since there are 35 people per class, it's kind of
like you can put a face to the name for everyone.

12:52.330 --> 12:54.420
The advancement rate to college is on the high side,

12:54.420 --> 12:56.960
but there are students who find employment
or go to vocational school.

12:57.580 --> 13:01.960
Also, club activities are rather popular. Like,
what you'd call doing well in both school and sports?

13:02.630 --> 13:04.920
Sasaki-kun, you're good at explaining.

13:04.920 --> 13:09.130
You too, Natsukawa. After all, we're each
a big brother and big sister, you know?

13:09.130 --> 13:10.170
You think so?

13:10.420 --> 13:13.290
How's Airi-chan? I want to see her again.

13:13.290 --> 13:15.330
What!? That's...

13:21.170 --> 13:23.750
That's... Maybe some other time...

13:23.750 --> 13:26.790
Oh, yeah... Sorry that was so sudden.

13:27.540 --> 13:29.170
Everyone! Are you keeping up?

13:29.170 --> 13:30.130
Yes!

13:30.750 --> 13:34.750
Natsukawa-senpai, why did
you choose Koetsu High School?

13:35.210 --> 13:40.670
Huh? It is a college prep school, and also probably
because the uniforms were the cutest, I think.

13:40.670 --> 13:44.540
Yes, I agree! The uniforms here are cute, aren't they!?

13:44.750 --> 13:47.790
Also, they say the school regulations
are relatively relaxed.

13:48.250 --> 13:50.880
Does Mishirohama have a sense of being strict after all?

13:51.170 --> 13:54.000
You get scolded just for having bedhead.

13:55.250 --> 13:57.290
It's that fine young lady education thing.

13:57.460 --> 13:58.670
Right!?

13:58.920 --> 14:03.540
The girls here have a Morals & Discipline Committee too,
so on that point, it may not be different, though...

14:03.960 --> 14:09.380
That is okay! Morals & Discipline Committee
Chair Shinomiya! She is my aspiration!

14:09.790 --> 14:14.960
I mean, even though we say it's relaxed here,
I think it's different than being a so-called unruly crowd.

14:15.330 --> 14:19.130
After you do what you should do, there's a sense
of evenness between responsibility and freedom.

14:19.130 --> 14:21.750
Does that mean there are a lot of people
here who are sincere by nature?

14:21.750 --> 14:24.460
I'm not sure. But that might be so.

14:24.790 --> 14:25.420
Next is-

14:25.420 --> 14:27.960
For real!? You're already taken!?

14:28.080 --> 14:28.830
Huh?

14:29.210 --> 14:31.330
Obviously, you've like kissed and stuff, right?

14:31.580 --> 14:33.500
More than that? Like when?

14:33.500 --> 14:35.630
Th-that's none of your business!

14:36.080 --> 14:38.830
Y-you guys... That's enough-

14:38.830 --> 14:42.000
What!? Tell us at least that much!

14:42.170 --> 14:43.460
We wanna know!

14:43.710 --> 14:45.130
That's not good, I think?

14:47.710 --> 14:49.000
What're you doing!?

14:49.500 --> 14:51.920
This isn't the stipulated route, is it?

14:52.170 --> 14:53.420
Natsukawa-san...?

14:53.420 --> 14:55.290
Aizawa-san, you okay?

14:55.630 --> 14:57.500
Whoa! Super cute!

14:57.830 --> 14:59.880
I'm definitely getting into Koetsu!

14:59.880 --> 15:01.500
I'm okay with older women!

15:03.580 --> 15:05.250
Wh-what...?

15:05.250 --> 15:09.000
This school doesn't need kids like you, I think.

15:09.250 --> 15:11.670
Wh-what's up with that?

15:12.170 --> 15:15.460
I'm saying we don't need you. Didn't you hear me?

15:16.170 --> 15:18.880
But we took the effort to come to
the school visit tour, you know?

15:19.540 --> 15:21.330
We didn't ask you to come here.

15:21.670 --> 15:25.000
The ones who are challenging themselves to
the entrance exam to get into here, are you guys.

15:27.000 --> 15:31.580
We're simply the guides and that doesn't
mean we're here to curry favor with you.

15:31.880 --> 15:32.500
Right!?

15:32.500 --> 15:34.210
Huh!? Oh, yeah!

15:38.460 --> 15:40.580
You might want to come see the cultural festival too.

15:41.040 --> 15:45.920
In recent times, many schools have reduced the scale
of things, but apparently Koetsu livens it up.

15:45.920 --> 15:47.880
Wow! That sounds nice!

15:48.210 --> 15:49.580
I'm looking forward to it too!

15:49.580 --> 15:51.000
Let's definitely come, okay!?

15:51.000 --> 15:52.670
Definitely come! Definitely!

15:53.000 --> 15:55.830
Next time I'd like Sajo-san to show me around...

15:56.130 --> 15:57.790
Oh! That person, right!?

15:57.790 --> 15:59.830
Fuka is fantasizing again!

16:00.080 --> 16:02.040
I-it's not like a fantasy...!

16:02.500 --> 16:05.330
Natsukawa... You're able to say things in that way, huh?

16:05.330 --> 16:08.130
I guess I'm used to annoying boys.

16:08.130 --> 16:08.830
Ah...

16:11.630 --> 16:13.830
That's about it for the school tour.

16:14.670 --> 16:18.420
Those who want to, can avail themselves of
the school cafeteria and you can observe club activities.

16:19.380 --> 16:20.630
Are you guys done too?

16:21.540 --> 16:22.750
We're sorry!

16:23.250 --> 16:25.710
We legitimately are serious about
wanting to get in here, so...

16:25.960 --> 16:29.210
When that happens, if you would
look after us as kouhai, that would be...

16:29.630 --> 16:32.080
I got it. Do your best then.

16:32.460 --> 16:33.290
Okay...

16:36.290 --> 16:37.130
Um...

16:37.630 --> 16:39.790
Thank you very much for today.

16:40.790 --> 16:42.630
Not at all. My pleasure...

16:46.460 --> 16:47.790
Oh... Wataru.

16:47.790 --> 16:48.630
Sajo-san!

16:48.630 --> 16:49.330
What!?

16:49.540 --> 16:51.040
Sajo-san!

16:51.040 --> 16:51.790
Huh!?

16:52.630 --> 16:58.330
Huh!? Sasaki-san!? And Sasaki... And... Natsukawa!?

16:58.630 --> 17:02.210
What!? What's with this line-up!? I have a bad feeling...

17:02.830 --> 17:06.380
It is the school visit tour!
I did not expect to be able to see you!

17:06.380 --> 17:08.380
Huh!? Oh, I see...

17:12.540 --> 17:13.460
Uh-oh!

17:13.880 --> 17:16.460
These two senpai were showing us around!

17:16.460 --> 17:18.130
I see. That makes sense...

17:18.330 --> 17:21.420
What!? Is this kind of chance encounter even possible!?

17:21.790 --> 17:24.790
Hey Fuka? Is this person, that Sajo-san?

17:24.790 --> 17:26.630
What!? Which Sajo-san!?

17:26.630 --> 17:30.040
C'mon! Don't say something like that here of all places!

17:30.380 --> 17:34.420
That Sajo-san, who taught Fuka-chan, who
wasn't good with words, to use polite language?

17:34.630 --> 17:35.420
What!?

17:35.630 --> 17:39.920
That Sajo-san, who taught Fuka, who was way too
immersed in the shojo manga world, to see reality?

17:40.080 --> 17:40.920
What!?

17:40.920 --> 17:44.630
That Sajo-san, who taught
common sense to a ditzy Fuka?

17:44.630 --> 17:45.580
What!?

17:45.750 --> 17:47.790
Wh-who or which Sajo-san is that!?

17:47.790 --> 17:52.830
Th-th-that's not true! I'm not way
too immersed and I'm not like ditzy!

17:53.210 --> 17:57.040
Huh!? Was Sasaki-san kind of like this?

17:57.670 --> 18:01.670
Unlike when she's with me or Ichinose-san,
she seems childlike, or rather...

18:01.830 --> 18:05.630
Sajo-senpai! Please take care of Fuka, okay!?

18:05.960 --> 18:08.250
So, she's this kind of kid, but she's a good kid!

18:08.580 --> 18:13.420
Too late now! Plus, Sajo-san and I
already have a deep relationship!

18:13.580 --> 18:14.540
What!?

18:14.750 --> 18:19.750
He is kind, and well-informed, and polite,
and even for the outing the other day, he properly...

18:21.630 --> 18:23.420
Hang on! Hey, Sasaki-san!?

18:23.420 --> 18:27.000
Um! Uh, um! That's not what I meant, and...!

18:27.460 --> 18:30.170
Um! It's about time! We should be taking our leave!

18:28.790 --> 18:31.500
Huh!? What!? Hey, Fuka-chan!?

18:31.880 --> 18:35.170
Thank you for your time! Everyone,
we should excuse ourselves for today!

18:32.880 --> 18:35.630
Jeez, what's up with that!?

18:35.330 --> 18:37.330
W-wait!

18:38.630 --> 18:41.330
It's like you get the feeling
they're middle schoolers, you know?

18:41.330 --> 18:42.420
That's true...

18:44.210 --> 18:46.290
Okay then, Sajo, good luck!

18:46.670 --> 18:47.170
Oh!

18:47.290 --> 18:49.040
What!? Uh, hey! Sasaki!?

18:53.580 --> 18:58.460
Um... Hello, Natsukawa..."san"...?

18:58.960 --> 18:59.960
What do you want?

18:59.960 --> 19:02.170
Oh! No... It's nothing...

19:03.750 --> 19:04.540
Come with me.

19:04.540 --> 19:05.080
What!?

19:06.080 --> 19:08.500
Huh! Uh-huh!

19:09.000 --> 19:13.790
So, Sajotchi, huh!? He was kind,
and well-informed, and what else?

19:13.790 --> 19:14.540
Polite.

19:14.540 --> 19:17.130
Polite, huh!? And then?

19:17.130 --> 19:18.130
The outing.

19:18.130 --> 19:20.130
Yeah, that's right! The outing!

19:20.330 --> 19:24.040
In spite of how you said you were busy;
it seems you were having fun in various ways.

19:24.040 --> 19:28.500
No, I wasn't particularly having fun! Although
it's probably true that various things happened, but...

19:28.920 --> 19:30.170
Various things happened. Like what?

19:30.170 --> 19:32.630
Hmpf! It's not good to ask such boorish questions...

19:32.750 --> 19:34.250
The swimsuit photo.

19:35.040 --> 19:36.130
I'll talk...

19:39.250 --> 19:40.540
I see now.

19:40.920 --> 19:42.580
Well then, let me borrow your smartphone.

19:42.580 --> 19:45.500
May I ask why!? I have already spilled
the beans on everything, though!

19:45.500 --> 19:47.710
That and this are separate issues.

19:49.420 --> 19:51.380
P-plus, it's embarrassing...

19:51.830 --> 19:55.920
I won't just let it sit in my data folder!
I'll look at it on a regular basis!

19:55.920 --> 19:57.290
That's why I don't like that!

19:57.580 --> 20:00.580
You know, Sajotchi, you are honest
about that kind of stuff.

20:00.580 --> 20:03.210
See? Even Ashida is saying so...

20:05.790 --> 20:06.540
Idiot...

20:06.540 --> 20:07.250
Whew...

20:08.750 --> 20:12.790
In exchange... You have to hang out with us too...

20:12.790 --> 20:13.420
What?

20:14.330 --> 20:15.420
It's fine if you don't want to...

20:15.750 --> 20:19.670
Hang on, wait! I didn't hear you just now!
Really! One more time!

20:20.170 --> 20:22.460
You have to hang out with us too!

20:22.880 --> 20:27.210
Me!? Hang out with Natsukawa; with you guys...?

20:27.830 --> 20:34.250
Th-that's right... If you have time to hang out with
other people, then you can at least do that, right?

20:36.420 --> 20:37.580
You don't want to?

20:37.580 --> 20:39.790
No, I do want to! I am grateful!

20:39.790 --> 20:41.290
Why do you sound like a samurai?

21:00.500 --> 21:02.960
So annoying! Or so it seems, right?

21:03.250 --> 21:06.500
Aw! I wish I hadn't said that...

21:07.330 --> 21:13.500
But you know, why're you suddenly making
that curt face towards me...?

21:15.210 --> 21:17.420
A text that's been left on read and abandoned

21:17.420 --> 21:19.710
But there are replies if it’s a group text, kind of thing

21:19.920 --> 21:21.880
I thought we were close, but then you became distant

21:22.130 --> 21:23.670
Why am I this lonely?

21:23.670 --> 21:25.540
You're not going to chase after me, today?

21:25.540 --> 21:27.080
I wish I could be honest with myself

21:28.540 --> 21:34.880
That's because it's the first time
I learned there's such a heartrending feeling...

21:34.880 --> 21:36.290
And yet, hey!

21:36.290 --> 21:37.830
Why're you going away??

21:37.830 --> 21:39.580
Why is it a secret!?

21:39.790 --> 21:41.960
I'm full of frustration and...

21:41.960 --> 21:43.330
Oh! Oh!

21:43.330 --> 21:45.040
I can't say something like this

21:45.040 --> 21:49.000
But earlier those weren't my true feelings

21:49.000 --> 21:50.380
Let that get through to you

21:50.460 --> 21:52.080
Why do I get angry...?

21:52.080 --> 21:53.670
I can't be cute...

21:53.670 --> 21:56.130
You don't like me anymore...??

21:56.290 --> 21:59.000
Oh! Oh! Oh, oh!

22:01.000 --> 22:01.960
Why?

22:02.630 --> 22:03.920
Don't hate me

22:06.960 --> 22:08.330
...Listen, "You see...!"

22:13.040 --> 22:14.460
<b>Sajo, Aika, K</b>

22:13.460 --> 22:14.460
<b>What should we do to hang out?</b>

22:14.710 --> 22:17.790
<b>Since there's Airi, the choices are limited, though.</b>

22:15.880 --> 22:17.790
<b>Sajo</b>

22:15.880 --> 22:17.790
<b>Oh! Natsukawa's little sister!</b>

22:16.750 --> 22:17.790
<b>The ocean again?</b>

22:19.040 --> 22:20.040
<b>Nice!</b>

22:20.040 --> 22:24.040
<b>Aika</b>

22:20.040 --> 22:24.040
<b>With these members, the ocean is a no-go.</b>

22:22.040 --> 22:24.040
<b>Ha ha. Since it would be swimsuits.</b>

22:24.040 --> 22:25.290
<b>Dejected!</b>

22:25.290 --> 22:28.290
<b>Dejected!</b>

22:27.290 --> 22:28.290
<b>Aika</b>

22:27.290 --> 22:28.290
<b>Want to come to my house?</b>

22:28.290 --> 22:29.540
<b>I like that!</b>

22:29.790 --> 22:33.380
<b>Plus, it wouldn't be a burden for Airi.</b>

22:31.790 --> 22:36.330
<b>Alright!</b>

22:33.290 --> 22:36.330
<b>Hang on. Sajotchi, you alive?</b>

22:36.580 --> 22:40.580
<b>Sajo</b>

22:36.580 --> 22:40.580
<b>I'm alive.</b>

22:37.580 --> 22:40.580
<b>Aika</b>

22:37.580 --> 22:40.580
<b>You know, it's not like I'm asking you</b>

22:37.590 --> 22:40.580
<b>to force yourself to come.</b>

22:40.580 --> 22:44.080
<b>Sajo</b>

22:40.580 --> 22:44.080
<b>I'll live going!</b>

22:41.880 --> 22:44.080
<b>Sajo</b>

22:41.880 --> 22:44.080
<b>I'll die going!</b>

22:43.130 --> 22:44.080
<b>Sajo</b>

22:43.130 --> 22:44.080
<b>I'm going!</b>

22:44.080 --> 22:46.080
<b>Calm down!</b>

22:45.080 --> 22:46.080
<b>Sajo</b>

22:45.080 --> 22:46.080
<b>Okay!</b>

22:46.080 --> 22:48.080
<b>Don't say or do anything weird to Airi, okay?</b>

22:48.080 --> 22:52.080
<b>Sajo</b>

22:48.080 --> 22:52.080
<b>Of course!</b>

22:49.330 --> 22:54.330
<b>Don't do things like pranks or jokes that</b>

22:49.330 --> 22:54.330
<b>a child won't understand, okay?</b>

22:52.080 --> 22:54.330
<b>Come properly dressed in a clean and neat outfit.</b>

22:54.330 --> 22:58.790
<b>Aika</b>

22:54.330 --> 22:58.790
<b>Do a proper greeting.</b>

22:54.340 --> 22:58.790
<b>I don't like those with bad manners.</b>

22:57.040 --> 22:58.790
<b>Aichi, let's stop around there.</b>

22:58.960 --> 23:01.040
<b>So, if it was just me, then that's</b>

22:58.960 --> 23:01.040
<b>one thing, but Airi will be there.</b>

23:01.040 --> 23:02.040
<b>Sajo</b>

23:01.040 --> 23:02.040
<b>As you wish!</b>

23:02.040 --> 23:03.080
<b>Please</b>

23:02.040 --> 23:03.080
<b>I leave it to what you think is best.</b>

23:03.080 --> 23:05.080
<b>As you wish!</b>

23:03.080 --> 23:05.080
<b>Sajo</b>

23:03.090 --> 23:05.080
<b>Please</b>

23:03.090 --> 23:05.080
<b>I leave it to what you think is best.</b>

23:03.090 --> 23:05.080
<b>I mean it.</b>

23:10.540 --> 23:12.040
Hey. So, Aichi...

23:12.040 --> 23:13.630
Huh? What's up?

23:14.080 --> 23:18.540
I understand how you feel, but it'd be better
if you didn't come down hard on Sajotchi too strongly.

23:20.170 --> 23:23.130
At this rate, the distance will end up
steadily getting wider again, you know?

23:24.500 --> 23:28.960
Aichi, I want you and Sajotchi to both be happy, so...

23:30.000 --> 23:30.750
Yeah...

23:33.130 --> 23:34.210
What's up?
